# Mobile App Component File Convention

When creating or refactoring React components in `apps/mobile-app/components`:

1. Create each component in its own dedicated `component-name.tsx` file (kebab-case).
2. Keep styles in a matching `component-name.style.ts` file.
3. Do not use inline styles in component JSX.
4. Import styles from the colocated style file: `import { styles } from './component-name.style';`.
5. Create or update a local `index.ts` barrel in the component folder and export the component.
6. Do not place multiple new components in one file unless explicitly requested.

Preferred folder pattern:

- `component-name.tsx`
- `component-name.style.ts`
- `index.ts`
